      <a href="https://github.com/hansakoch" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">github.com/hansakoch</a> ·
      <a href="https://x.com/hansakoch" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">x.com/hansakoch</a> ·
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/hanskoch/" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">facebook.com/hanskoch</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <hr style="border:none;border-top:2px solid var(--accent);margin:0 auto 32px auto;max-width:200px;">

  <div class="md-card" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:16px;">Professional Summary</h2>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:10px;">Digital marketing since 1999. Early on <a href="https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw" style="color:var(--accent-dim);font-weight:600;">OpenClaw</a> (January 2025 at 18.7K ⭐, now <strong><span id="openclaw-stars">388K</span> ⭐</strong>). I build agents that work around the clock across distributed nodes.</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Director & CMO of <a href="https://icebergmedia.co.uk" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">Iceberg Media</a> (2012–present) — UK SEO, now pivoting to Cloudflare-first agents across 145+ domains.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="md-card">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center;">Core Competencies</h2>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:8px;">
      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Autonomous Ai Agent Architecture</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Cloudflare Workers, D1, KV, Pages</span>
