      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Prompt Engineering & LLM Orchestration</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Full-Stack Development (TS, Python, Bash)</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Strategic Business Pivoting (SEO → Ai)</span>
