      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">SEO, PPC, Google Analytics (20yr)</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Client Relationship Management (14yr)</span>
      <span style="display:inline-block;background:#2a1a1a;color:var(--accent);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.8rem;margin:3px 4px;">Crypto/Web3 Architecture</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Professional Experience -->
  <div class="md-card">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center;">Professional Experience</h2>

    <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);">Ai Systems Architect & Founder</h3>
    <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">OpenRoyleAl</strong> · January 2025 – Present</p>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin-bottom:24px;">
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Architected sovereign Ai infrastructure using Cloudflare Workers, D1, Vectorize, and Durable Objects — always online, globally distributed.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Built multi-node distributed task execution with 6-second average latency across Linux and Android nodes.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Managing 63+ API keys and secrets in D1 with secure tool-based access for autonomous operations.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Running 24/7 infrastructure: Surface laptop (Linux, 7.2GB), Android Pi (ethernet, 7.5GB), Cloudflare Workers.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Built install.openroyleal.com — zero-click node onboarding for distributed Ai agents.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);">Agency Search Director & Ai Transition Lead</h3>
    <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);"><a href="https://icebergmedia.co.uk" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">Iceberg Media</a></strong> · August 2022 – Present · Manchester, UK</p>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin-bottom:24px;">
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Leading strategic pivot from 14-year SEO agency (Iceberg Media, 2012–present) to Ai services company.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Transitioned pricing from £300/month SEO retainers to enterprise Ai agent implementation projects with recurring revenue.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Designed Cloudflare-first architecture: Workers, Pages, DNS, security across 145+ domains.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Managing 168 Google Business Profiles and approximately 110 domains.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:4px;font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;">Built and managed teams of 10+ across development, virtual support, and sales.</li>
    </ul>

