    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">Cloudflare Agent Memory</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(cf-memory-plugin)</span> — Persistent memory for agents. HTTP in, Cloudflare recall out. <a href="https://github.com/hansakoch/cf-memory-plugin" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">GitHub</a> · <a href="https://cloudflare-memory.pages.dev" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">cloudflare-memory.pages.dev</a> · <a href="https://alfred.report" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">alfred.report</a></p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">OpenRoyleAl</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(2025–Present)</span> — Ai project umbrella: sovereign infrastructure, multi-node agents, autonomous operations. Running 24/7 across Surface laptop, Android Pi, and Cloudflare Workers.</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">Messagewith.me</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(2025–Present, Alpha)</span> — Open-source form submission platform on Cloudflare stack. Designed to replace Basin for 43 agency clients with AI reply suggestions, lead quality scoring, and Deploy-to-Cloudflare self-host under MIT licence.</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">FansFollow.me (FFM Network)</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(2023–Present, In Development)</span> — Creator platform embedding OpenClaw: every creator and fan gets their own AI agent for content promotion, fan engagement, and monetisation. Planned FFM Token crypto tokenomics for decentralised compute. Positioned for investment.</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">Reservewith.me / Orderwith.me</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(2025–Present, Beta)</span> — Booking and ordering platforms. Cloudflare Workers + D1.</p>
