    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">IcebergSites</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(Cloudflare Workers + TypeScript)</span> — Automated local SEO site deployment per client. Deploys to dedicated Cloudflare Worker per company. Full SOP documented. Portfolio of Delta sites built with Ai.</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">Ai4SEO.co.uk</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(2025)</span> — Proof-of-concept AI-powered SEO automation platform. Evolved into broader Ai business solution.</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:0;"><strong style="color:var(--text);">Rosari.org</strong> <span style="color:var(--muted);">(2025–Present, Delta)</span> — Traditional Catholic prayer and devotional platform.</p>
