    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;"><strong>Keynote Speaking</strong> — Ai and business transformation, SEO and digital marketing strategy, open-source agents (USA, UK)</p>
  </div>

  <div class="md-card">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:16px;text-align:center;">Technical Skills</h2>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Ai & Agents:</strong> OpenClaw, Claude Code, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Grok (xAI), prompt engineering, autonomous agent architecture</p>
