    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Languages:</strong> TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Bash, HTML/CSS</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>DevOps:</strong> GitHub Actions, wrangler CLI, systemd, Linux administration, cron automation</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Marketing:</strong> Google Analytics, Google Ads, Microsoft Advertising, Facebook Ads, SEO tools, Google Business Profile (168 locations)</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Business:</strong> Stripe, Wise, Highrise CRM (14yr data, 12K+ contacts), GoHighLevel, Zapier</p>
    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#ccc;"><strong>Early:</strong> First Webmaster — High School (1999), 20+ years SEO, Google Ads & Cloudflare certified</p>
  </div>

  <div class="no-print" style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--muted);">
    <p>
      <a href="/resume" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">📄 Resume</a> ·
      <a href="/cover-letter" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">📝 Cover Letter</a> ·
      <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--accent-dim);">📬 Contact</a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:12px;">
      <a href="#" onclick="window.print();return false;" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:0.85rem;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(255,51,51,0.3);">🖨️ Download PDF</a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:6px;font-size:0.75rem;">Opens print dialog — choose "Save as PDF"</p>
  </div>

  <script>
    (async () => {
      try {
        const res = await fetch('https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw');
        if (res.ok) {
          const data = await res.json();
          if (data.stargazers_count) {
            const s = (data.stargazers_count / 1000).toFixed(0) + 'K';
            const el1 = document.getElementById('openclaw-stars');
            const el2 = document.getElementById('openclaw-stars2');
            if (el1) el1.textContent = s;
            if (el2) el2.textContent = s;
          }
        }
      } catch (e) {}
    })();
  </script>

  <style>
    @media print {
      body { background: white !important; color: #111 !important; }
      h1, h2, h3 { color: #111 !important; }
      hr { border-color: #111 !important; }
      a { color: #111 !important; text-decoration: none !important; }
      .container { padding: 0 !important; max-width: 100% !important; }
      .md-card { box-shadow: none !important; border: none !important; background: white !important; padding: 12px 0 !important; }
      .no-print { display: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
